ate. Summary is not available in this mode."\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "隱藏總結頁簡報",\n          "description": "隱藏總結頁簡報."\n        },\n        {\n          "label": " \\"查看解法\\" 功能鈕",\n          "description": "設定所有問題是否顯示\\"查看解法\\"功能鈕，全部啟用或是禁用.",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "啟用"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "禁用"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": " \\"重試\\" 功能鈕",\n          "description": "設定所有問題是否顯示\\"重試\\"功能鈕，全部啟用或是禁用.",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "啟用"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "禁用"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Show \\"Show solution\\" button in the summary slide",\n          "description": "If enabled, the learner will be able to show the solutions for all question when they reach the summary slide"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Show \\"Retry\\" button in the summary slide",\n          "description": "If enabled, the learner will be able to retry all questions when they reach the summary slide. Be advised that by refreshing the page the learners will be able to retry even if this button isn''t showing."\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "啟用列印功能鈕",\n          "description": "啟用此列印功能鈕."\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "社交分享設定",\n          "description": "這些選項將讓您覆蓋社交行為設定. 如果提供了連結, 空值將會被自動填入, 否則將產生所有值.",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "顯示Facebook分享圖示"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Facebook分享設定",\n              "fields": [\n                {\n                  "label": "分享到Facebook(連結)",\n                  "default": "@currentpageurl"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "分享到Facebook(引用)",\n                  "default": "我在@currentpageurl的任務上@maxScore得分@score"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n        