(66, 'sr', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Панели",\n      "entity":"panel",\n      "field":{\n        "label":"Садржај",\n        "entity":"content",\n        "fields":[\n          {\n            "label":"Наслов"\n          },\n          {\n            "label":"Тип садржаја",\n            "entity":"content"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label":"H ознаке за налепнице (не утиче на величину налепнице)",\n      "description":"Ознака h се користи на налепницама. Уобичајено је H2, али ако ово спада под наслов H2, користите H3. Не утиче на величину налепница, користе се само у семантичке сврхе.",\n      "options":[\n        {\n          "label":"H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'sv', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Paneler",\n      "entity": "panel",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "Innehåll",\n        "entity": "innehåll",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "Titel"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "Innehållstyp",\n            "entity": "innehåll"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "H-taggar för etiketter (påverkar inte storleken på etiketten)",\n      "description": "H-taggen som används för etiketter. Vanligtvis H2 men om denna hör hemma under en H2-rubrik så bör du använda H3. Påverkar inte storleken på etiketterna, används endast av semantiska skäl.",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'sw', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Paneli",\n      "entity": "paneli",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "Maudhui",\n        "entity": "maudhui",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "Mada"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "Aina ya maudhui",\n            "entity": "maudhui"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "Vitambulisho vya kichwa kwenye ukurasa wa wavuti kwa lebo (haviathiri ukubwa wa lebo)",\n      "description": "Kitambulisho cha kichwa h kinachotumika kwenye lebo. Kawaida ni H2 lakini ikiwa iko chini ya kichwa cha H2, tumia H3. Haiathiri ukubwa wa lebo, inatumika tu kwa madhumuni ya kisemantiki.",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'te', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "entity": "ప్యానెల్",\n      "field": {\n        "entity": "కంటెంట్",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "శీర్షిక"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "కంటెంట్ రకం",\n            "entity": "కంటెంట్"\n          }\n        ],\n        "label": "కంటెంట్"\n      },\n      "label": "ప్యానల్స్"\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "లేబుల్స్ కొరకై H ట్యాగ్స్ (ఇది లేబుల్ సైజును మార్పు చేయదు)",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ],\n      "description": "H ట్యాగ్స్ లేబుల్స్ కై వాడతారు. సాధారణంగా H2 కానీ ఇది H2 హెడ్డింగ్ కింద ఉన్నట్లైతే H3 వాడండి. ఇది లేబుల్స్ సైజును మార్పు చేయదు, సెమాంటిక్ ప్రయోజనాల కోసం మాత్రమే ఉపయోగించబడుతుంది."\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'th', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "แผงข้อมูล",\n      "entity": "แผงข้อมูล",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "เนื้อหา",\n        "entity": "เนื้อหา",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "ชื่อเรื่อง"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "ประเภทเนื้อหา",\n            "entity": "เนื้อหา"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "แท็กหัวเรื่อง (H tag) สำหรับข้อความ (ไม่ส่งผลต่อขนาดข้อความ)",\n      "description": "แท็กหัวเรื่อง (H tag) จะถูกใช้กับข้อความ ปกติจะเป็นรูปแบบ H2 โดยจะไม่ส่งผลต่อขนาดข้อความ แต่จะใช้เพื่อระบุความสำคัญในด้านระบบ",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'tr', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Paneller",\n      "entity": "panel",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "İçerik",\n        "entity": "içerik",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "Başlık"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "İçerik türü",\n            "entity": "içerik"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "Etiketler için H etiket değeri (etiketin boyutunu etkilemez)",\n      "description": "Etiketler üzerinde kullanılan h etiketi. Normalde H2 kullanılır fakat H2 altındaysa bunu H3 olarak kullanın. Etiketlerin boyutunu etkilemeyecektir, sadece anlamsal amaçlar için kullanıldı.",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'uk', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Панелі",\n      "entity":"панель",\n      "field":{\n        "label":"Вміст",\n        "entity":"вміст",\n        "fields":[\n          {\n            "label":"Назва"\n          },\n          {\n            "label":"Тип матеріалу",\n            "entity":"Тип матеріалу"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label":"H теги використовуються для міток (не впливають на розмір заголовка)",\n      "description":"Теги виду ''h'' використовуються в якості міток. Зазвичай використовують мітку з тегом H2. Але якщо Ваша мітка вже знаходиться під заголовком H2, використовуйте H3. Вибір того чи іншого тега h не впливає на розмір міток, використовується тільки в семантичних цілях.",\n      "options":[\n        {\n          "label":"H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'vi', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Panels",\n      "entity": "panel",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "Nội dung",\n        "entity": "nội dung",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "Tiêu đề"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "Dạng nội dung",\n            "entity": "nội dung"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "H tags for labels (does not affect the size of the label)",\n      "description": "The h tag used on the labels. Normally H2 but if this belongs under an H2 heading use H3. Does not affect the size of the labels, only used for semantical purposes.",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'zh-cn', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "面板",\n      "entity": "面板",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "内容",\n        "entity": "内容",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "标题"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "内容类型",\n            "entity": "内容"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "标题标签（不影响标签的大小）",\n      "description": "标签使用的H标签。标签上使用的H标签。通常为H2，但如果属于H2标题，则使用H3。不影响标签的大小，仅用于语义目的。",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'zh-hans', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "所有区块",\n      "entity": "区块",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "区块",\n        "entity": "内容",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "标题"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "内容",\n            "entity": "内容"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "字级设定",\n      "description": "这个设定与显示的字体尺寸无关，只是用来作为语义比重用途，一般是用 H2（标题2），但如果在通篇内容有更重要的字是 H2 时，就可改成 H3，依此类推。",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(66, 'zh-hant', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "所有區塊",\n      "entity": "panel",\n      "field": {\n        "label": "區塊",\n        "entity": "content",\n        "fields": [\n          {\n            "label": "標題"\n          },\n          {\n            "label": "內容",\n            "entity": "content"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "字級設定",\n      "description": "這個設定與顯示的字體尺寸無關，只是用來作為語義比重用途，一般是用 H2（標題2），但如果在通篇內容有更重要的字是 H2 時，就可改成 H3，依此類推。 ",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "label": "H2"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H3"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "H4"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'ar', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "معاينة",\n      "description": "يمكنك تحريك الصور حولها بسحبها. يمكنك أيضًا تحديد صورة ثم استخدام مفتاحي + أو - في لوحة المفاتيح للتكبير أو ببساطة الضغط باستمرار على المفتاح Z أثناء تحريك عجلة الماوس.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "النسق",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "خيارات العرض",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "الارتفاع"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "التباعد"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "الإطار"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "قصاصات",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "قصاصة",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "صورة"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "الازاحة",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "اعلى"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "يسار"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "النص البديل",\n                "description": "مطلوب. إذا تعذر على المتصفح تحميل الصورة ، فسيتم عرض هذا النص بدلاً من ذلك. تستخدم أيضا من قبل تقنية  تحويل النص الى كلام."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "النص الحائم",\n                "description": "اختياري. يتم عرض هذا النص عندما يمرر المستخدمالمؤشر فوق الصورة."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Scale"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'bg', '{\r\n  "semantics": [\r\n    {\r\n      "label": "Преглед",\r\n      "description": "Можете да премествате (премествате) изображенията, като ги плъзнете. Можете също да изберете изображение и след това да използвате клавишите + или - на клавиатурата, за да увеличите или просто да задържите бутона Z, докато движите мишката.",\r\n      "fields": [\r\n        {\r\n          "label": "Оформление",\r\n          "options": [\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "1"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "1-1"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "2"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "2-1"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "1-2"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "2-2"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "3-1"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "1-3"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "2-3"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "3-2"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "3-3"\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          "label": "Опции за показване",\r\n          "fields": [\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "Височина"\r\n\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "Разстояние"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              "label": "Рамка"\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          "label": "Клипове",\r\n          "entity": "клип",\r\n          "field": {\r\n            "label": "Клип",\r\n            "fields": [\r\n              {\r\n                "label": "Изображение"\r\n              },\r\n              {\r\n                "label": "Изместване",\r\n                "fields": [\r\n                  {\r\n                    "label": "Горе"\r\n                  },\r\n                  {\r\n                    "label": "Ляво"\r\n                  }\r\n                ]\r\n              },\r\n              {\r\n                "label": "Алтернативен текст",\r\n                "description": "Задължително. Ако браузърът не може да зареди изображението, вместо него ще се покаже този текст. Също така се използва от читателите."\r\n              },\r\n              {\r\n                "label": "Текст при поставяне на мишката",\r\n                "description": "Не е задължително. Този текст се показва, когато потребителят задържа мишката върху изображението."\r\n              },\r\n              {\r\n                "label": "Мащаб"\r\n              }\r\n            ]\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}'),
(67, 'bs', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Pregled",\n      "description":"Možete pomijerati sliku okolo tako da je kliknete i nosite. Također možete označiti sliku i onda koristiti + i - na tastaturi da je zumirate ili jednostavno da držite slovo Z dok vrtite točak na mišu.",\n      "fields":[\n        {\n          "label":"Raspored",\n          "options":[\n            {\n              "label":"1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Opcije prikaza",\n          "fields":[\n            {\n              "label":"Visina"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Razmak"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Okvir"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Klipovi",\n          "entity":"klip",\n          "field":{\n            "label":"Klip",\n            "fields":[\n              {\n                "label":"Slika"\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"ofset",\n                "fields":[\n                  {\n                    "label":"Veh"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label":"Lijevo"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternative text",\n                "description": "Required. If the browser can''t load the image this text will be displayed instead. Also used by readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover text",\n                "description": "Optional. This text is displayed when the user hovers his pointing device over the image."\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Skaliranje"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'ca', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Previsualització",\n      "description": "Per moure (desplaçar) les imatges, arrossegueu-les. Podeu seleccionar una imatge i utilitzar les tecles + o - del teclat per ampliar-la o reduir-la, o mantenir premuda la tecla Z mentre moveu la rodeta del ratolí.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Disseny",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Mostra les opcions",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Alçària"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Espaiat"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Marc"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Imatge"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Imprès",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "A dalt"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Esquerre"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Text alternatiu",\n                "description": "Requerit. Si el navegador no pot carregar la imatge es mostrarà aquest text. També s’utilitza per a lectors de “text a veu”."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Text que es mostra en passar el cursor per sobre",\n                "description": "Opcional. Aquest text es mostra quan l’usuari passa el dispositiu d’apuntar per sobre de la imatge."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Escala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'cs', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Náhled",\n      "description": "Obrázky můžete pohybovat (posouvat) jejich přetažením. Můžete také vybrat obrázek a poté pomocí kláves + nebo - na klávesnici zvětšit nebo jednoduše podržet klávesu Z a pohybovat kolečkem myši.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Rozložení",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Volby zobrazení",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Výška"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Vzdálenost"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Rámeček"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Klipy",\n          "entity": "Klip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Klip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Obrázek"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Nastavení odstupu",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Nahoře"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Vlevo"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternativní text",\n                "description": "Povinné. Pokud prohlížeč nemůže načíst obrázek, zobrazí se místo toho tento text. Používá se také pro čtecí zařízení."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Text při najetí kurzoru",\n                "description": "Volitelné. Tento text se zobrazí, když uživatel umístí své polohovací zařízení nad obrázek."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Měřítko"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'cy', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Rhagolwg",\n      "description": "Gallwch chi symud delweddau o gwmpas (tremio) gan eu llusgo. Gallwch chi hefyd ddewis delwedd a defnyddio''r allweddi + neu - i chwyddo neu, yn syml, dal yr allwedd Z tra''n symud olwyn y llygoden.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Gosodiad",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Opsiynau arddangos",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Uchder"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Bylchiad"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Ffrâm"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clipiau",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Delwedd"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Atred (offset)",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Top"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Chwith"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Testun amgen",\n                "description": "Angenrheidiol. Os yw''r porwr yn methu â llwytho''ch delwedd, caiff y testun hwn ei arddangos. Hefyd, caiff ei ddefnyddio gan ddarlenyddion."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Testun hofro",\n                "description": "Opsiynol. Caiff y testun hwn ei arddaangos wrth i''r defnyddiwr hofro''i ddyfais bwyntio (e.e. llygoden) dros y ddelwedd."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Graddfa"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'da', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Eksempel",\n      "description":"Rækkefølgen ændres ved at trække billederne til den ønskede position. Alternativt, zoom ved at vælge et billede og bruge + eller - tasterne på tastaturet. Alternativt hold z tasten nede på tastaturet og zoom med hjulet på musen.",\n      "fields":[\n        {\n          "label":"Layout",\n          "options":[\n            {\n              "label":"1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Display options",\n          "fields":[\n            {\n              "label":"Højde"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Mellemrum"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Ramme"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Clips",\n          "entity":"clip",\n          "field":{\n            "label":"Clip",\n            "fields":[\n              {\n                "label":"Image"\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Offset",\n                "fields":[\n                  {\n                    "label":"Top"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label":"Left"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternative text",\n                "description": "Required. If the browser can''t load the image this text will be displayed instead. Also used by readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover text",\n                "description": "Optional. This text is displayed when the user hovers his pointing device over the image."\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Scale"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'de', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Vorschau",\n      "description": "Du kannst die Bilder durch Ziehen verschieben. Du kannst auch ein Bild anwählen und dann die + oder - Tasten auf deiner Tastatur zum Zoomen benutzen oder dafür die Taste Z gedrückt halten und das Mausrad drehen.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Layout",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Darstellungsoptionen",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Höhe"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Abstand"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Rahmen"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "Clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Bild"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Versatz",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Oben"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Links"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternativtext",\n                "description": "Erforderlich. Falls das Bild nicht geladen werden kann, wird dieser Text stattdessen angezeigt. Wird auch von Vorlesewerkzeugen genutzt (Barrierefreiheit)."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Mouseover-Text",\n                "description": "Optional. Dieser Text wird angezeigt, wenn der Mauszeiger über dem Bild ruht."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Maßstab"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'el', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Προεπισκόπηση",\n      "description":"Μπορείτε να μετακινήσετε τις εικόνες σύροντάς τις. Μπορείτε επίσης να επιλέξετε μια εικόνα και στη συνέχεια να χρησιμοποιήσετε τα πλήκτρα + ή - στο πληκτρολόγιό σας για μεγέθυνση/σμίκρυνση αντίστοιχα ή απλά να κρατήσετε πατημένο το πλήκτρο Z ενώ μετακινείτε τη ροδέλα του ποντικιού σας.",\n      "fields":[\n        {\n          "label":"Διάταξη",\n          "options":[\n            {\n              "label":"1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-3"\n             }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Ρυθμίσεις εμφάνισης",\n          "fields":[\n            {\n              "label":"Ύψος"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Διάστημα"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Πλαίσιο"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Στιγμιότυπα",\n          "entity":"στιγμιοτυπου",\n          "field":{\n            "label":"Στιγμιότυπο",\n            "fields":[\n              {\n                "label":"Εικόνα"\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Στάθμιση",\n                "fields":[\n                  {\n                    "label":"Πάνω"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label":"Αριστερά"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Εναλλακτικό κείμενο",\n                "description": "Απαιτείται. Αυτό το κείμενο θα εμφανιστεί σε περίπτωση που ο φυλλομετρητής αδυνατεί να φορτώσει την εικόνα. Θα χρησιμοποιηθεί επίσης και κατά την ακουστική υποβοήθηση."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Επεξηγηματικό κείμενο",\n                "description": "Προαιρετικό. Αυτό το κείμενο εμφανίζεται όταν ο χρήστης περνά τον κέρσορα πάνω από την εικόνα."\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Κλίμακα"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n');
INSERT INTO `wpcu_h5p_libraries_languages` VALUES
(67, 'es', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Previsualización",\n      "description": "Usted puede mover (pan) las imágenes al arrastrarlas. También puede seleccionar una imagen y entonces usar kas teclas + o - en su teclado para acercarse o simplemente mantener oprimida la tecla Z mientras mueve su rueda del ratón.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Diseño",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Opciones de visualización",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altura"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Espaciado"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Marco"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Recortes",\n          "entity": "recorte",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Recorte",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Imagen"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Sesgo",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Superior"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Izquierda"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto alternativo",\n                "description": "Requerido. Si el navegador no puede cargar la imagen este texto será mostrado en su lugar. También usado por Lectores de texto en voz alta."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto al pasar ratón encima",\n                "description": "Opcional. Este texto es mostrado cuando el usuario pasa su puntero del ratón sobre la imagen."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Escala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'es-mx', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Previsualización",\n      "description": "Usted puede mover (pan) las imágenes al arrastrarlas. También puede seleccionar una imagen y entonces usar las teclas + o - en su teclado para acercarse o simplemente mantener oprimida la tecla Z mientras mueve su rueda del ratón.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Diseño",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Opciones de visualización",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altura"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Espaciado"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Marco"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Recortes",\n          "entity": "recorte",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Recorte",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Imagen"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Sesgo",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Superior"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Izquierda"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto alternativo",\n                "description": "Requerido. Si el navegador no puede cargar la imagen este texto será mostrado en su lugar. También usado por Lectores de texto en voz alta."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto al pasar ratón encima",\n                "description": "Opcional. Este texto es mostrado cuando el usuario pasa su puntero del ratón sobre la imagen."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Escala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'et', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Eelvaade",\n      "description": "Pilte saad liigutada neid lohistades. Pildi suuruse muutmiseks vali pilt ja kasuta klaviatuuri + ja - klahve või hoia all Z klahvi, pöörates samal ajal hiire ketast.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Asetus",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Kuva valikud",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Kõrgus"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Vahed"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Raam"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Lõiked",\n          "entity": "lõige",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "lõige",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Pilt"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Kaugus",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Ülalt"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Vasakult"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternatiivne tekst",\n                "description": "Nõutud. Kui brauser ei saa pilti laadida, siis näidatakse pildi asemel seda teksti. Seda teksti kasutatakse ka tekstilugeriga."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Abitekst",\n                "description": "Ei ole kohustuslik. Seda teksti näidatakse, kui kasutaja hoiab osutusseadme kursorit pildi kohal."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Skaala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'eu', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Aurrebista",\n      "description": "Irudiak arrastatuz mugitzen ahal dituzu. Posible duzu ere irudia hautatu eta + eta – teklen bidez zooma egiteko edo Z tekla sakatuta eragin saguaren gurpilari handitzeko edo txikitzeko.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Diseinua",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Bistaratzeko aukerak",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altuera"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Tartea"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Markoa"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Klipak",\n          "entity": "klip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Klip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Irudia"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Desplazamendua",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Goia"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Ezkerra"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Ordezko testua",\n                "description": "Beharrezkoa. Nabigatzaileak irudia ezin badu kargatu testu hau irudiaren ordez agertuko da. Irakurtzeko bozgorailuak ere erabiliko du."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Desplazamendu testua",\n                "description": "Aukerakoa. Testu hau bistaratzen da erabiltzaileak punteroa irudiaren gainetik pasatzen duenean."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Eskala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'fa', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "پیش‌نمایش",\n      "description": "شما می‌توانید تصویرها را با کشیدن آنها حرکت دهید. شما همچنین می‌توانید یک تصویر انتخاب کنید و سپس با استفاده از کلیدهای + و - روی صفحه کلید یا نگه داشتن کلید Z و حرکت چرخ ماوس بزرگنمایی یا کوچکنمایی کنید.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "طرح‌بندی",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "۱"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۱-۱"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۲"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۲-۱"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۱-۲"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۲-۲"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۳-۱"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۱-۳"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۲-۳"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۳-۲"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "۳-۳"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "گزینه‌های نمایش",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "ارتفاع"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "فاصله‌گذاری"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "قاب"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "کلیپ‌ها",\n          "entity": "کلیپ",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "کلیپ",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "تصویر"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "آفست",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "بالا"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "چپ"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "متن بدیل",\n                "description": "الزامی. اگر مرورگر نتواند تصویر را بارگذاری کند، این متن به جای آن نمایش داده می‌شود. همچنین مورد استفاده مبدل متن به گفتار قرار می‌گیرد."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "متن شناور",\n                "description": "اختیاری. این متن وقتی نمایش داده می‌شود که کاربر ماوس را روی تصویر می‌برد."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "مقیاس"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'fi', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Esikatselu",\n      "description":"Voit liikuttaa kuvaa raahaamalla. Voit valita kuvan ja sitten käyttää + tai - näppäimiä (tai pitää Z-näppäintä painettuna, kun liikutat hiiren pyörää) zoomataksesi.",\n      "fields":[\n        {\n          "label":"Asettelu",\n          "options":[\n            {\n              "label":"1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Näyttövalinnat",\n          "fields":[\n            {\n              "label":"Korkeus"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Välistys"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Kehys"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Leikkeet",\n          "entity":"leike",\n          "field":{\n            "label":"Leike",\n            "fields":[\n              {\n                "label":"Kuva"\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Etäisyys",\n                "fields":[\n                  {\n                    "label":"Ylhäältä"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label":"Vasemmalta"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Vaihtoehtoinen teksti.",\n                "description": "Pakollinen tieto. Jos selain ei pysty lataamaan kuvaa tämä teksti näytetään kuvan sijasta. Myös ruudunlukijat lukevat tämän tiedon."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover teksti",\n                "description": "Vapaaehtoinen. Tämä teksti näytetään kun käyttäjä vie hiirenkursorin kuvan päälle. "\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Koko"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'fr', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Aperçu",\n      "description":"Vous pouvez déplacer chaque image en la faisant glisser. Après avoir sélectionné une image, vous pouvez appuyer sur les touches + et - de votre clavier pour zoomer. Sinon, maintenez enfoncée la touche Z du clavier, tout en faisant rouler la molette de la souris.",\n      "fields":[\n        {\n          "label":"Modèle",\n          "options":[\n            {\n              "label":"1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Options d''affichage",\n          "fields":[\n            {\n              "label":"Hauteur"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Espacement"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Cadre"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Découpes",\n          "entity":"découpe",\n          "field":{\n            "label":"Découpe",\n            "fields":[\n              {\n                "label":"Image"\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Décalage (offset)",\n                "fields":[\n                  {\n                    "label":"En haut"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label":"A gauche"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternative text",\n                "description": "Required. If the browser can''t load the image this text will be displayed instead. Also used by readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover text",\n                "description": "Optional. This text is displayed when the user hovers his pointing device over the image."\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Echelle"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'gl', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Vista previa",\n      "description": "Podes moverte polas imaxes arrastrándoas. Tamén podes seleccionar unha imaxe e usar as teclas + ou - do teclado para facer zoom ou simplemente premer a tecla Z mentras moves a roda do rato.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Deseño",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Opcións de visualización",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altura"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Espazado"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Marco"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Imaxe"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Compensación",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Superior"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Esquerda"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto alternativo",\n                "description": "Requerido. Amosarase esta mensaxe se o navegador non pode amosar a imaxe. Usado tamén polos lectores de pantalla."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto baixo o cursor",\n                "description": "Opcional. Este texto amosarase cando o usuario poña o punteiro do rato enriba da imaxe."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Escala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'it', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Anteprima",\n      "description": "Puoi spostare le immagini intorno alla zona di trascinamento. Puoi anche selezionare un''immagine e poi usare i tasti + o - della tastiera per zoommare, o semplicemente tenere premuto il tasto Z mentre muovi la ruota del tuo mouse",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Layout",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Mostra opzioni",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altezza"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Spaziatura"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Frame"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clip",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Immagine"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Offset",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "In alto"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Sinistra"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Testo alternativo",\n                "description": "Obbligatorio. Se il browser non può caricare l''immagine sarà mostrato questo testo. Usato anche dai lettori vocali"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Testo in sovraimpressione",\n                "description": "Facoltativo. Questo testo viene mostrato quando l''utente passa sopra l''immagine con il suo puntatore"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Scala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'ko', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "미리보기",\n      "description": "이미지를 드래그해서 움직일 수 있다. 또한 이미지를 선택한 다음 키보드의 + 또는 - 키를 사용하여 확대 축소하거나 마우스 휠을 움직이는 동안 Z 키를 눌러 확대축소 가능.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "배열",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "선택사항 표시",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "높이"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "간격"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "프레임"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "클립",\n          "entity": "클립",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "클립",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "이미지"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "오프셋",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "위로"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "왼쪽"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "대체 텍스트",\n                "description": "필수. 브라우저에서 이미지를 로드할 수 없는 경우 이 텍스트가 대신 표시된다. 또한 자동 문장 읽어주기에 의해 사용."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "호버 텍스트",\n                "description": "선택사항. 이 텍스트는 사용자가 이미지 위에 포인팅 장치를 올려놓으면 표시됨."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "스케일"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'lt', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Peržiūra",\n      "description": "You can move(pan) the images around by dragging them. You can also select an image and then use the + or - keys on your keyboard to zoom or simply hold down the Z key while moving your mouse wheel.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Išdėstymas",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Display options",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Height"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Spacing"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Frame"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Paveiksliukas"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Offset",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Top"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Left"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternatyvus tekstas",\n                "description": "Required. If the browser can''t load the image this text will be displayed instead. Also used by readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Užvesto pelės žymeklio tekstas",\n                "description": "Optional. This text is displayed when the user hovers his pointing device over the image."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Skalė"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'lv', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Izkārtojums",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Atspoguļojuma opcijas",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Augstums"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Atstarpes"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Rāmis"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Klipi",\n          "entity": "klips",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Klips",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Attēls"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Ofsets",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Augša"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Kreisā mala"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternatīvais teksts",\n                "description": "Obligāti. Ja pārlūkprogramma nevar ielādēt attēlu, tā vietā tiks parādīts šis teksts. Izmanto arī asistīvās tehnoloģijas."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Kursora novietošanas teksts",\n                "description": "Neobligāts. Šis teksts tiks atspoguļots, kad lietotājs virs attēla novietos peles kursoru."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Mērogs"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      "label": "Priekšskatījums",\n      "description": "Variet pārvietot (panoramēt) attēlus, velkot tos. Variet arī atlasīt attēlu un pēc tam izmantot tastatūras taustiņus + vai -, lai tuvinātu, vai vienkārši turēt nospiestu taustiņu Z, pārvietojot peles ritenīti."\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'mn', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Урьдчилан үзэх",\n      "description": "Та зургуудыг чирж хөдөлгөж болно. Та мөн зургийг сонгоод дараа нь гар дээрх + эсвэл - товчлуурыг ашиглан томруулж эсвэл хулганы дугуйгаа хөдөлгөж байхдаа Z товчийг удаан дарах боломжтой.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Зохион байгуулалт",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Дэлгэцийн сонголтууд",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Өндөр"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Зай"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Хүрээ"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Клип",\n          "entity": "Клип",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Клип",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Зураг"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Офсет",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Топ"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Зүүн"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Альтернатив текст",\n                "description": "Шаардлагатай. Хэрэв хөтөч зургийг ачаалж чадахгүй бол оронд нь энэ текст гарч ирнэ. Уншигчид бас ашигладаг."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Гарч ирэх Текст",\n                "description": "Сонголттой. Хэрэглэгч заагч төхөөрөмжөө зураг дээр аваачих үед энэ текст гарч ирнэ."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Хэмжээ"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'nb', '{\n  "semantics":[\n    {\n      "label":"Fordhåndsvisning",\n      "description":"Dru kan flytte bilder rundt ved å dra de. Du kan bruke + og - for å justere størrelsen når et bilde er valgt, eller ved å holde inne ''Z'' og bruker musehjulet.",\n      "fields":[\n        {\n          "label":"Oppsett",\n          "options":[\n            {\n              "label":"1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Visningsalternativer",\n          "fields":[\n            {\n              "label":"Høyde"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Avstand"\n            },\n            {\n              "label":"Ramme"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label":"Klipp",\n          "entity":"klipp",\n          "field":{\n            "label":"Klipp",\n            "fields":[\n              {\n                "label":"Bilde"\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Forskyvelse",\n                "fields":[\n                  {\n                    "label":"Topp"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label":"Venstre"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternativ tekst",\n                "description": "Obligatorisk. Denne teksten vises hvis nettleseren ikke kan laste bildet. I tilleg brukes den av readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Svevetekst",\n                "description": "Valgfri. Denne teksten vises når brukeren flytter muspekeren over bildet."\n              },\n              {\n                "label":"Skalering"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'nl', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Voorbeeld",\n      "description": "Je kunt de afbeeldingen verplaatsen door ze te verslepen. Je kunt ook een afbeelding selecteren en dan op de + of - knop drukken om te zoomen of houd de Z-knop ingedrukt terwijl je het muiswiel draait.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Lay-out",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Toon opties",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Hoogte"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Tussenruimte"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Lijst"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Fragmenten",\n          "entity": "fragment",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Fragment",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Afbeelding"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Compensatie",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Boven"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Links"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternatieve tekst",\n                "description": "Verplicht. Als de browser de afbeelding niet kan tonen zal deze tekst getoond worden. Ook gebruikt door schermlezers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover tekst",\n                "description": "Optioneel. Deze tekst wordt getoond als de gebruiker met de muis over de afbeelding zweeft."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Schaal"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'nn', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Layout",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Display options",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Height"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Spacing"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Frame"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Image"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Offset",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Top"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Left"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternative text",\n                "description": "Required. If the browser can''t load the image this text will be displayed instead. Also used by readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover text",\n                "description": "Optional. This text is displayed when the user hovers his pointing device over the image."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Scale"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "clip"\n        }\n      ],\n      "label": "Preview",\n      "description": "You can move(pan) the images around by dragging them. You can also select an image and then use the + or - keys on your keyboard to zoom or simply hold down the Z key while moving your mouse wheel."\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'pt', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Pré-visualização",\n      "description": "Pode mover (deslocar) as imagens arrastando-as. Também pode selecionar uma imagem e utilizar as teclas + ou - do seu teclado ou simplesmente manter pressionada a tecla Z enquanto gira a roda do rato para mais ou menos zoom.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Estrutura",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Opções de exibição",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altura"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Espaçamento"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Quadro"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Trechos",\n          "entity": "trecho",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Trecho",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Imagem"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Posição",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Topo"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Esquerda"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto alternativo",\n                "description": "Obrigatório. Se o navegador não for capaz de mostrar a imagem, será exibido este texto. Também utilizado por leitores de ecrã."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto ao passar o rato",\n                "description": "Opcional. Este texto será exibido se o utilizador passar o ponteiro do rato sobre a imagem."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Escala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'pt-br', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Pré-visualização",\n      "description": "Você pode mover (deslocar) as imagens arrastando-as. Você também pode selecionar uma imagem e então utilzar as teclas + ou - no seu teclado ou simplesmente pressionar a tecla Z enquanto move a roda do mouse para dar zoom.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Layout",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Opções de exibição",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Altura"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Espaçamento"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Quadro"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clipes",\n          "entity": "clipe",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clipe",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Imagem"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Deslocamento",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Topo"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Esquerda"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto alternativo",\n                "description": "Obrigatório. Se o navegador não for capaz de exibir a imagem, este texto será exibido. Também utilizado por leitores de tela."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Texto flutuante",\n                "description": "Opcional. Este texto será exibido se o usuário colocar o ponteiro sobre a imagem."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Escala"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'ru', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Предосмотр",\n      "description": "Расположение изображения может быть изменено, если потянуть картинку в определенную сторону. Для приближения и отдаления картинки можно нажать + или -, так же зажав на клавиатуре Z + прокручивать колесико мышки.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Расположение",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Опции",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Высота"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Промежутки"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Рамка"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Изображение"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Отступ",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Верхнее"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Левое"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Альтернативный текст",\n                "description": "Обязательно. В случае, если браузер не сможет загрузить изображение, будет отображен данный текст."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Нависающий текст",\n                "description": "Необязательно. Данный текст отобразится при скольжении мышки на картинку."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Размер"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'sl', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Predogled",\n      "description": "Prizor na izbrani sliki se lahko dodatno določi s potegom miške (povleci &amp; spusti). Spremembo povečave se določi z izbiro slike in tipkama + ter -, ali držanjem tipke Z ter vrtenjem kolesca na miški.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Postavitev",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Možnosti prikaza",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Višina"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Razmik"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Okvir"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Posnetki",\n          "entity": "posnetek",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Posnetek",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Slika"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Odmik",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Zgoraj"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Levo"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Nadomestno besedilo",\n                "description": "Zahtevano. Besedilo se prikaže, če spletni brskalnik ne more naložiti slike. Besedilo uporabljajo tudi bralniki zaslona."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Besedilo ob preletu miške",\n                "description": "Neobvezno. Besedilo se prikaže, ko uporabnik sliko preleti s kazalcem miške."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Merilo"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(67, 'sma', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Preview",\n      "description": "You can move(pan) the images around by dragging them. You can also select an image and then use the + or - keys on your keyboard to zoom or simply hold down the Z key while moving your mouse wheel.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Layout",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-1"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "1-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "2-3"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-2"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "3-3"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Display options",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Height"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Spacing"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Frame"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Clips",\n          "entity": "clip",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Clip",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Image"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Offset",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Top"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Left"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Alternative text",\n                "description": "Required. If the browser can''t load the image this text will be displayed instead. Also used by readspeakers."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Hover text",\n                "description": "Optional. This text is displayed when the user hovers his pointing device over the image."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Scale"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n');
