(95, 'ko', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "학습 가지 시나리오 편집기",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "제목"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "화면 시작",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "화면 제목 시작",\n              "placeholder": "코스 제목"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "화면 부제목 시작",\n              "placeholder": "코스 세부 내용"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "스크린 이미지 시작"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "이미지 대안 텍스트"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "마지막 화면 리스트",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "화면 끝내기",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "제목"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "텍스트"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "이미지"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "점수",\n                "description": "기본 종료 시나리오에 도달한 사용자를 위해 H5P로부터 점수를 받는 모든 LMS, LRS 또는 기타 연결된 서비스에 점수를 전송함."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "콘텐츠 ID"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "학습 가지 시나리오 콘텐츠 리스트",\n          "entity": "콘텐츠",\n          "field": {\n            "fields": [\n              {},\n              {\n                "label": "Show content title in view",\n                "description": "If selected, the user will see the content title in the top bar above this content."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Text for the proceed button (max length: 50 characters)",\n                "default": "Proceed"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Override require content finished",\n                "description": "Override the individual settings for requiring the content to be finished before activating the \\"Proceed\\" button. Will not have any effect if the content doesn''t indicate if it was \\"finished\\", e.g. images or course presentations with just one slide.",\n                "options": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Use behavioural setting"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Enabled"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Disabled"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {},\n              {\n                "label": "Feedback",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback title"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback text"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback image"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Score for this scenario",\n                    "description": "The score will be sent to any LMS, LRS or any other connected service that receives scores from H5P for users who reach this scenario."\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Navigate back",\n                "description": "This will allow the user to go back and see the previous content/question in the scenario.",\n                "options": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Use behavioural setting"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Enabled"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Disabled"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "채점 기준",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "채점 기준",\n              "description": "채점 유형 선택",\n              "options": [\n                {\n                  "label": "각 엔드 시나리오에 대해 정적으로 점수를 설정"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "사용자 답변에서 동적으로 점수 계산"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "점수 없음"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "분기 시나리오 내의 상호 작용 점수 포함",\n              "description": "선택되면 예를 들어 대화형 비디오에서 선택한 점수가 획득한 총 점수에 추가됩니다. 선택되지 않으면 컨텐츠 항목, 분기 질문 및 종료 시나리오의 피드백 섹션에 지정된 점수만 반영됩니다."\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "행동설정",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "콘텐츠 완료 필수 재정의",\n              "description": "\\"Proceed\\" (진행) 버튼 활성화 전에 콘텐츠 완료 필수에 대한 개별 설정을 다시 합니다. \\"finished\\" (완료)되었음을 표시하지 않는 콘텐츠(예&gt;이미지 혹은 한 장의 슬라이드만 있는 코스 프레젠테이션)이면 영향을 받지 않습니다."\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "시청 필수",\n              "description": "시나리오를 진행하기 전에 시청자에게 비디오, 상호작용형 비디오 및 코스 프레젠테이션을 완료하도록 요청합니다. 내용 수준에서 재정의할 수 있습니다."\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Randomize Branching Questions",\n              "description": "Branching questions will be displayed in random order"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "맞춤 설정",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "시작 화면의 버튼에 대한 텍스트",\n              "default": "코스 시작"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "끝 화면의 버튼에 대한 텍스트",\n              "default": "코스 재시작"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "각 라이브러리 화면의 버튼에 대한 텍스트",\n              "default": "진행"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the disabled button on the library screens",\n              "default": "Require to complete the current module"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the button used to replay a video",\n              "default": "Replay the video"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "최종 스크린에서 점수에 대한 라벨",\n              "default": "점수:"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "전체 화면 라벨",\n              "default": "전체화면"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(95, 'lt', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Išsišakojusio scenarijaus redaktorius",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Pavadinimas"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Pradžios ekranas",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Kurso pavadinimas",\n              "placeholder": "Jūsų kurso pavadinimas"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Išsami informacija apie kursą",\n              "placeholder": "Išsami informacija apie kursą"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Kurso paveiksliukas"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Alternatyvus paveiksliuko tekstas"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Pabaigos užsklandų sąrašas",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Pabaigos ekranas",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Pavadinimas"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Tekstas"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Paveiksliukas"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Rezultatas",\n                "description": "Rezultatas bus išsiųstas į bet kurią LMS, LRS ar bet kurią kitą prijungtą paslaugą, kuri gauna balus iš H5P naudotojams, kurie pasiekia numatytąjį pabaigos scenarijų."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Turinio ID"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Išsišakojusio scenarijaus turinio sąrašas",\n          "entity": "turinys",\n          "field": {\n            "fields": [\n              {},\n              {\n                "label": "Rodyti turinio pavadinimą rodinyje",\n                "description": "Jei pasirinkta, naudotojas matys turinio pavadinimą viršutinėje juostoje virš šio turinio."\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Mygtuko „Tęsti“ tekstas (maksimalus ilgis: 50 simbolių)",\n                "default": "Tęsti"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Override require content finished",\n                "description": "Override the individual settings for requiring the content to be finished before activating the \\"Proceed\\" button. Will not have any effect if the content doesn''t indicate if it was \\"finished\\", e.g. images or course presentations with just one slide.",\n                "options": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Naudoti elgsenos nustatymus"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Įjungta"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Išjungta"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {},\n              {\n                "label": "Feedback",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback title"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback text"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Atsiliepimo paveikslėlis"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Balas šiam scenarijui",\n                    "description": "The score will be sent to any LMS, LRS or any other connected service that receives scores from H5P for users who reach this scenario."\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Grįžti atgal",\n                "description": "This will allow the user to go back and see the previous content/question in the scenario.",\n                "options": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Naudoti elgsenos nustatymus"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Įjungta"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Išjungta"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Balų skaičiavimo parinktys",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Balų skaičiavimo parinktys",\n              "description": "Pasirinkite įvertinimo tipą.",\n              "options": [\n                {\n                  "label": "Statiškai nustatyti kiekvieno pabaigos scenarijaus rezultatą"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Dinamiškai apskaičiuoti rezultatą iš naudotojo atsakymų"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Nėra balų"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Įtraukti rezultatus iš sąveikų pagal išsišakojimą",\n              "description": "If chosen scores from for instance Interactive Videos will be added to the total score obtained. If not chosen only scores specified in the feedback sections of the content items, branching questions and end scenarios will count."\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Veikimo nustatymai",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Grįžti atgal",\n              "description": "This will allow user to go back and see the previous content/question in the scenario. This can be overridden on a content level"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Privaloma peržiūrėti",\n              "description": "Ragina žiūrovus užbaigti vaizdo įrašą, interaktyvų vaizdo įrašą ir kurso pristatymą prieš tęsiant scenarijų. Tai gali būti nepaisoma turinio lygiu."\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Atsitiktinai sudėliokite išsišakojusius klausimus",\n              "description": "Branching questions will be displayed in random order"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Lokalizacija",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the button on the start screen",\n              "default": "Pradėti kursą"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the button on the end screen",\n              "default": "Pradėti kursą iš naujo"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the back button on each of the library screens and branching questions",\n              "default": "Atgal"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the disabled button on the library screens",\n              "default": "Reikalauti užbaigti dabartinį modulį"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the button used to replay a video",\n              "default": "Pakartoti vaizdo įrašą"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Label for score on the end screen",\n              "default": "Tavo balas:"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Aria label for fullscreen button",\n              "default": "Visas ekranas"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(95, 'lv', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "Zarošanās scenārija redaktors",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Nosaukums"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Sākuma ekrāns",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Kursa nosaukums",\n              "placeholder": "Jūsu kursa nosaukums"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Kursa rekvizīti",\n              "placeholder": "Detalizēta informācija par kursu"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Kursa attēls"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Attēla alternatīvais teksts"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Beigu ekrānu saraksts",\n          "field": {\n            "label": "Beigu ekrāns",\n            "fields": [\n              {\n                "label": "Nosaukums"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Teksts"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Attēls"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Rezultāts",\n                "description": "Rezultāts tiks nosūtīts uz jebkuru LMS, LRS vai jebkuru citu savienotu pakalpojumu, kas saņem rezultātus no H5P lietotājiem, kuri sasniedz scenārija noklusējuma beigas"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Satura ID"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Zarošanās scenārija satura saraksts",\n          "entity": "saturs",\n          "field": {\n            "fields": [\n              {},\n              {\n                "label": "Rādīt satura nosaukumu skatā",\n                "description": "Ja atlasīts, lietotājs redzēs satura nosaukumu augšējā joslā virs šī satura"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Text for the proceed button (max length: 50 characters)",\n                "default": "Turpināt"\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Override require content finished",\n                "description": "Override the individual settings for requiring the content to be finished before activating the \\"Proceed\\" button. Will not have any effect if the content doesn''t indicate if it was \\"finished\\", e.g. images or course presentations with just one slide.",\n                "options": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Use behavioural setting"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Enabled"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Disabled"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {},\n              {\n                "label": "Feedback",\n                "fields": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback title"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback text"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Feedback image"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Score for this scenario",\n                    "description": "The score will be sent to any LMS, LRS or any other connected service that receives scores from H5P for users who reach this scenario."\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                "label": "Navigate back",\n                "description": "This will allow the user to go back and see the previous content/question in the scenario.",\n                "options": [\n                  {\n                    "label": "Use behavioural setting"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Enabled"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "label": "Disabled"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Punktu skaitīšanas iestatījumi",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Punktu skaitīšanas iestatījumi",\n              "description": "Izvēlieties punktu skaitīšanas veidu",\n              "options": [\n                {\n                  "label": "Statiski iestatiet punktu skaitu katram beigu scenārijam"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Dinamiski aprēķināt punktu skaitu no lietotāja atbildēm"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Nav punktu"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Iekļaut mijiedarbību rezultātus zarošanās scenārija punktu skaitā",\n              "description": "Ja izvēlēts, punkti, piemēram, no interaktīvajiem video, tiks pievienoti iegūtajam kopvērtējumam. Ja nav izvēlēts, tiks ņemti vērā tikai zarojošo jautājumu un scenārija beigu ekrānu atgriezeniskās saites sadaļās norādītie punkti."\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Uzvedības iestatījumi",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Atspējot navigāciju atpakaļ",\n              "description": "Ignorēt individuālos navigācijas atpakaļ iestatījumus"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Ignorēt pabeigšanai obligātā satura iestatījumus",\n              "description": "Ignorēt atsevišķus iestatījumus, kas nosaka obligātu satura apguvi pirms pogas \\"Turpināt\\" aktivizēšanas. Neietekmēs saturu, kas nenorāda, ka ir \\"pabeigts\\", piemēram, attēli vai kursa prezentācija ar tikai vienu slaidu."\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Zarošanās jautājumus izkārtot nejauši",\n              "description": "Zarošanās jautājumi tiks izkārtoti nejaušā secībā"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Lokalizācija",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Sākuma ekrāna pogas teksts",\n              "default": "Sākt kursu"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Beigu ekrāna pogas teksts",\n              "default": "Atsākt kursu"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Pogas \\"Atpakaļ\\" teksts katram bibliotēkas ekrānam un zarošanās jautājumam",\n              "default": "Atpakaļ"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Text for the disabled button on the library screens",\n              "default": "Require to complete the current module"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Teksts pogai, ko izmanto, lai atkārtotu videoklipu",\n              "default": "Atkārtot videoklipu"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Rezultāta etiķete beigu ekrānā",\n              "default": "Tavs rezultāts:"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Lauka etiķete pilnekrāna pogai",\n              "default": "Pilnekrāna režīms"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
