(98, 'zh-cn', '{\n  "semantics": [\n    {\n      "label": "表格",\n      "default": "<table class=\\"h5p-table\\"><thead><tr><th scope=\\"col\\">标题栏1</th><th scope=\\"col\\">标题栏2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>行1列1</td><td>行1列2</td></tr><tr><td>行2列1</td><td>行2列2</td></tr></tbody></table>"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(99, 'ar', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "يوصى بتقديم ملاحظات تحفيزية وإرشادات. اترك جميع الحقول فارغة إذا كنت لا تريد أن يحصل المستخدم على ملاحظات بعد اختيار هذا البديل / عرض المحتويات هذه."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'cs', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Doporučujeme poskytnout zpětnou vazbu, která bude studenty motivovat a směřovat k dalšímu zlepšení. Pokud si nepřejete, aby studenti po zvolení této možnosti/zhlédnutí tohoto obsahu dostávali zpětnou vazbu, ponechte toto pole prázdné."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'de', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Es wird empfohlen, Feedback zu geben, das motiviert und gleichzeitig Hilfestellung ist. Lasse alle Felder leer, wenn die Lernenden kein Feedback erhalten sollen, nachdem diese Alternative gewählt wurde bzw. dieser Inhalt angesehen wurde."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'el', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Συνιστάται η παροχή ανατροφοδότησης που παρακινεί και παρέχει επίσης καθοδήγηση. Αφήστε όλα τα πεδία άδεια εάν δεν θέλετε ο χρήστης να λαμβάνει σχόλια αφού επιλέξει αυτήν την εναλλακτική/προβολή αυτού του περιεχομένου."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'en', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "It is recommended to provide feedback that motivates and also provides guidance. Leave all fields empty if you don''t want the user to get feedback after choosing this alternative/viewing this content."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'es', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Se recomienda proporcionar retroalimentación que motive y sirva como guía. Deja vacíos todos los campos si no deseas que el usuario reciba retroalimentación después de elegir esta alternativa/ver este contenido."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'es-mx', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Se recomienda proporcionar retroalimentación que motive y también proporcione guía. Deje vacíos todos los campos si no desea que el usuario obtenga retroalimentación después de elegir esta alternativa/ ver este contenido."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'eu', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Gidaritza ematen duen eta motibatzen duen feedbacka ematea gomendatzen da. Eremu guztiak hutsik utzi itzazu ez baduzu erabiltzaileak feedbackik jasotzea nahi eduki hau ikusi edo eduki honetako aukera hau hautatu ondoren."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'fa', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "توصیه می‌شود بازخوردی ارائه شود که هم تشویق می‌کند و هم راهنمایی می‌کند. اگر نمی‌خواهید کاربر پس از انتخاب این بدیل / مشاهده این محتوا بازخورد دریافت کند، همه فیلدها را خالی بگذارید."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'fr', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Il est recommandé de fournir un feedback qui motive et qui oriente. Ne saisissez aucun champ si vous voulez que l''utilisateur n''obtienne pas de feedback après avoir choisi cette alternative/visité ce contenu."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'gl', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Recoméndase proporcionar retroalimentación motivadora e que sirva de guía. Deixe baleiros todos os campos se non desexa que o usuario reciba retroalimentación despois de escoller esta alternativa ou ver este contido."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'ka', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "სასურველია გამოიყენოთ შეფასება, რომელიც იძლევა როგორც მოტივაციას, ისე რეკომენდაციას. ველები ცარიელი დატოვეთ თუ არ გინდათ, რომ მომხმარებელმა შეფასება მიიღოს ასეთის არჩევის შემთხვევაში."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'lt', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Rekomenduojama pateikti atsiliepimą, kuris motyvuoja ir pataria. Palikite laukus neužpildytus, jei norite, kad naudotojas negautų atsiliepimo, kai jis pasirinks peržiūrėti papildomą turinį."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'lv', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Ieteicams sniegt atgriezenisko saiti, kas motivē un sniedz ieteikumus. Atstājiet visus laukus tukšus, ja nevēlaties sniegt lietotājam atgriezenisko saiti pēc šī atbildes varianta/šī satura skatīšanas."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'mn', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Урам зориг өгөх, мөн удирдамж өгөх санал хүсэлтийг өгөхийг зөвлөж байна. Хэрэв та энэ хувилбарыг сонгосны дараа/энэ агуулгыг үзсэнийхээ дараа хэрэглэгчээс санал авахыг хүсэхгүй байгаа бол бүх талбарыг хоосон орхино уу."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'nb', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "It is recommended to provide feedback that motivates and also provides guidance. Leave all fields empty if you don''t want the user to get feedback after choosing this alternative/viewing this content."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'nl', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Het wordt aanbevolen alleen motiverende feedback te geven die ook sturing biedt. Laat alle velden leeg als je geen feedback geeft aan de gebruiker bij keuze van dit alternatief/bekijken van deze inhoud."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'nn', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "It is recommended to provide feedback that motivates and also provides guidance. Leave all fields empty if you don''t want the user to get feedback after choosing this alternative/viewing this content."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'pt', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Recomenda-se fornecer feedback que motive e também forneça orientação. Deixe todos os campos vazios se não quiser que o utilizador obtenha feedback após escolher esta alternativa/visualizar este conteúdo."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'pt-br', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Incentivamos você a dar feedback que forneça orientação e motivação. Deixe todos os campos em branco para escolher um método alternativo ou para impedir que os usuários recebam comentários após visualizar o conteúdo."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'sl', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Povratna informacija naj udeležence usmerja in hkrati motivira. Če ostanejo polja prazna, povratna informacija ne bo prikazana."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'sv', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Det är rekommenderat att ge feedback som motiverar och ger vägledning. Lämna alla fält tomma om du inte vill ge användaren feedback efter att ha valt detta alternativ/sett detta innehåll."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'sw', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Inapendekezwa kutoa maoni yanayohamasisha na pia kutoa mwongozo. Acha sehemu zote tupu ikiwa hutaki mtumiaji apate maoni baada ya kuchagua njia hii mbadala/kutazama maudhui haya."\n  }\n}\n'),
(99, 'tr', '{\n  "libraryStrings": {\n    "feedbackDescription": "Motive edici ve aynı zamanda rehberlik sağlayan geri bildirim sağlanması önerilir. Kullanıcının bu alternatifi seçtikten/bu içeriği görüntüledikten sonra geri bildirim almasını istemiyorsanız tüm alanları boş bırakın."\n  }\n}\n'),
