seaded",\n      "description": "Need valikud määravad, kuidas maailm käitub.",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Üldine heli",\n          "description": "Lisa heliriba, mis on vaikimisi kättesaadav kõikidele stseenidele."\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Stseeni renderdamise kvaliteet",\n          "description": "Vali laius- ja kõrgussegmentide arv, mida kasutatakse stseeni renderdamiseks. See mõjutab otseselt stseeni kvaliteeti. Stseeni parema välimuse saavutamiseks võid proovida kvaliteeti tõsta - samas laadib kõrgema kvaliteedi korral stseen aeglasemalt.",\n          "options": [\n            {\n              "label": "Kõrge kvaliteet (128x128)"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Keskmine kvaliteet (64x64)"\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Madal kvaliteet (16x16)"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Label settings",\n          "fields": [\n            {\n              "label": "Label position",\n              "description": "The default label position. The position may be overriden per interaction",\n              "options": [\n                {\n                  "label": "Right aligned"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Left aligned"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Top aligned"\n                },\n                {\n                  "label": "Bottom aligned"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              "label": "Display Labels",\n              "description": "If unchecked - labels will show only on mouse over"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "label": "Localize",\n      "fields": [\n        {\n          "label": "Aria label for content type",\n          "default": "Virtual Tour"\n        },\n        {\n          "label": "Label for to play audio",\n          "default": "Play Audio Track"\n        },\n        {\n